 functional network hubs in diabetic retinopathy patients", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000001620"}, {"@id": 2557, "n": "Functional connectivity pre-post exercise intervention in individuals with relapsing-remitting multiple sclerosis", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000001702"}, {"@id": 2558, "n": "Altered voxel-wise degree centrality associated with patients with comitant exotropia", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000001813"}, {"@id": 2559, "n": "Higher betweenness and degree centrality in the frontal and cerebellum cortex of Meige’s syndrome patients than hemifacial spasm patients", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000001865"}, {"@id": 2560, "n": "Abnormal degree centrality can be a potential imaging biomarker in first-episode, drug-naive bipolar mania", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000001896"}, {"@id": 2561, "n": "Structure-decoupled functional connectome-based brain age prediction provides higher association to cognition", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000001976"}, {"@id": 2562, "n": "Topological organization of the brain network in thyroid-associated ophthalmopathy using graph theoretical analysis", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000002108"}, {"@id": 2563, "n": "Network centrality alterations in patients with moyamoya disease after combined revascularization surgery: a resting-state fMRI study", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000002154"}, {"@id": 2564, "n": "Abnormal functional connectivity density in patients with obsessive-compulsive disorder.", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000002232"}, {"@id": 2565, "n": "A voxel-level degree centrality study in Parkinson's disease and the correlation with transcriptomes.", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0000000000002251"}, {"@id": 2566, "n": "Machine learning classifier using abnormal brain network topological metrics in major depressive disorder", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0b013e32835a650c"}, {"@id": 2567, "n": "From brain topography to brain topology: relevance of graph theory to functional neuroscience", "r": "doi:10.1097/wnr.0b013e3283621234"}